#. module: product_barcodelookup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_barcodelookup/wizard/product_fetch_image_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"Products are processed in the background. Images will be updated "
"progressively."
msgstr "ສິນຄ້າກຳລັງຖືກປະມວນຜົນໃນພື້ນຫຼັງ. ຮູບພາບຈະໄດ້ຮັບການອັບເດດຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ."

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_barcodelookup/wizard/product_fetch_image_wizard.py:0
msgid "The API Key for Barcode Lookup must be set in the General Settings."
msgstr "ຕ້ອງກຳນົດຄີ API ສຳລັບ Barcode Lookup ຢູ່ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທົ່ວໄປ."

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_barcodelookup/wizard/product_fetch_image_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The Barcode Lookup API key is not set properly or it is invalid. Check your "
"API key in setting and retry."
msgstr ""
"ຄີ API ຂອງ Barcode Lookup ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ກຳນົດຄ່າ. ກະລຸນາກວດສອບຄີ API ຂອງທ່ານໃນການຕັ້ງ"
"ຄ່າ ແລ້ວລອງໃໝ່ອີກຄັ້ງ."

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_barcodelookup.field_product_fetch_image_wizard__products_to_process
msgid ""
"The list of selected products that meet the criteria (have a barcode and no "
"image)"
msgstr "ລາຍການສິນຄ້າທີ່ເລືອກເຊິ່ງກົງກັບເງື່ອນໄຂ (ມີບາໂຄດ ແລະ ບໍ່ມີຮູບພາບ)"

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/product_barcodelookup/wizard/product_fetch_image_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"The scheduled action \"Product Images: Get product images from Barcode "
"Lookup\" has been deleted. Please contact your administrator to have the "
"action restored or to reinstall the module \"product_barcodelookup\"."
msgstr ""
"ການດຳເນີນການຕາມກຳນົດເວລາ \"Product Images: Get product images from Barcode "
"Lookup\" ຖືກລຶບແລ້ວ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ຜູ້ເບິ່ງແຍງລະບົບຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອກູ້ຄືນການດຳເນີນການ ຫຼື ຕິດຕັ້ງໂມດູນ "
"\"product_barcodelookup\" ຄືນໃໝ່."

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_product_barcodelookup
msgid ""
"This module allows you to create products from barcode using Barcode Lookup "
"API Key"
msgstr ""
"ໂມດູນນີ້ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາດສ້າງສິນຄ້າຈາກບາໂຄດ ໂດຍນຳໃຊ້ຄີ API ຂອງ Barcode Lookup"

#. module: product_barcodelookup
#: model:ir.model.fields,help:product_barcodelookup.field_product_product__is_image_fetch_pending
msgid "Whether an image must be fetched for this product. Handled by a cron."
msgstr "ກຳນົດວ່າຕ້ອງດຶງຮູບພາບສຳລັບສິນຄ້ານີ້ຫຼືບໍ່. ຈັດການໂດຍ cron."

